dget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">CURRICULUM OVERVIEW<\/h2>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-928ac3f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"928ac3f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>The 4-Year Bachelor&#8217;s\u00a0 Degree program <\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">contains 156 credits combining from 106 credits of coursework, 48 credits of internship and 2 credits of Industrial Placement Report. The courses are divided into three categories, including Common Courses, Specialized Courses, and Elective Courses.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2687135 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2687135\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"8\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>No.<\/th>\n      <th style=\"text-align:center;\">Course<\/th>\n      <th>Number of Courses<\/th>\n      <th>Hours<\/th>\n      <th>Credit<\/th>\n    <\/tr>\n  <\/thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">1<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 20px;\">Common courses<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">11<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">330<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">22<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">2<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 20px;\">Specialized courses<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">21<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,260<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">60<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">3<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 20px;\">Elective courses<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">9<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">360<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">24<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">4<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 20px;\">\n        \u2013 9 internships (1st, 2nd and 3rd year)<br>\n        \u2013 3 full-time internships\/ Industrial Placements in the 4th year at the industry = 30 credits*\n      <\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">12<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">2,160<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">48<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">5<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 20px;\">Industrial placement for whole 4th year and thesis defence<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">&#8212;<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">&#8212;<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">2<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n  <\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-418382c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"418382c\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7bc6ef8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7bc6ef8\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5837423 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5837423\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e26641 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2e26641\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd7dcf1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fd7dcf1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Bachelor of Architecture<\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ab0f16f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ab0f16f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Architecture has been defined diversely throughout history, and its practice has always been shaped by the advancement of innovative technology. Technology, particularly Artificial Intelligence (AI), has been dominating every aspect of our built environment. CamTech\u2019s Architecture Program is designed to equip students with the skills to use technology ethically, and its core is the smart Design Studio, which encourages students to have an in-depth understanding of building structures and critical issues in architectural design. Students will be able to immerse themselves in new, cutting-edge technology in construction and produce more sustainable buildings locally and internationally. We empower students to use new digital architecture technology such as AI, data analysis, 3D modeling for design, virtual reality, and so on to enable optimal design, sustainable architecture, energy efficiency, a safe environment, and time-saving. CamTech offers a work-integrated learning experience to develop students\u2019 employability, entrepreneurial, and leadership skills.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d673eb0 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d673eb0\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b960b51 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b960b51\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34fc553 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"34fc553\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8258dc1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8258dc1\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-35cb0b0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"35cb0b0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Bachelor of Interior Design\u200b<\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-069af96 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"069af96\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Interior Design at CamTech University focuses on the creation of innovative and exciting, lively interior spaces through the adaptation and spatial arrangement of buildings. The program is designed to equip students with an in-depth understanding of interior space, the relationship between the exterior and interior environment, the use of materials and their techniques for sustainability, and the practical skills and theoretical knowledge required to pursue a career in interior architecture and other related fields. Digital technologies such as augmented and virtual reality (AR &amp; VR) will be utilized to make interior spaces more intuitive in the real world before they are constructed. We empower students to use new digital architecture technology such as AI, data analysis, 3D modeling for design, virtual reality, and so on to enable optimal design, sustainable architecture, energy efficiency, a safe environment, and time-saving. CamTech offers a work-integrated learning experience to ensure students\u2019 employability, entrepreneurial, and leadership skills.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-80662b6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"80662b6\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2d529ff e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"2d529ff\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e143353 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e143353\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d6d85e3 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d6d85e3\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9cbd775 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9cbd775\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Teaching and Learning Methods<\/h3>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ab86a6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7ab86a6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The programs offered by the Department of Architecture &amp; Interior Design emphasize hands-on and project-based learning. All core courses are delivered through the following platforms:<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div