 and guidance (focusing on real-world issues).<\/span><\/p><ol><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Exchange Program: <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Opportunities for short-term exchange programs with our academic partners.\u00a0<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Research and Publication:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Promoting research activities with faculty members and partners.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Community and Society Involvement: <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Attending Green Day, Culture Day, Charity Day, and Environmental Day<\/span><b>.\u00a0<\/b><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Non-Profit Organizations: <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Collaborative work with non-governmental organizations, contributing to design solution proposals and transforming neighborhoods.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Government Agencies: <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Working with local authorities on various scales, from small installations to urban planning.<\/span><b>\u00a0<\/b><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Industry<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Inviting industry guests and practitioners.\u00a0<\/span><\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b13712e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b13712e\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d898d2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7d898d2\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ce492b2 e-transform elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"ce492b2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_transform_tr